    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Download the Super World War Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/89711eff7f5c9a233729ae85a9cf6551.avif?t=1755075426\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available to let you try Super World War! Play custom games against AI or in local multiplayer (up to 4 players). 3 characters, 4 maps (2 per game mode), 7 units, 5 buildings for a representative experience of Super World War!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note the game is still under development and content may be subject to change until release.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/066b027460b6c8383d3099c427f45736.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/066b027460b6c8383d3099c427f45736.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/066b027460b6c8383d3099c427f45736.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The President of the World, Theorn BrunceWald, is dead, leaving the seat he held for years up for grabs. Now\u2019s the perfect time for the other world leaders to make their move for global domination\u2014and so begins the Super World War!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRUSH YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/7b008a2d578cb7f7b0dfe653c2cec10f.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/7b008a2d578cb7f7b0dfe653c2cec10f.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/7b008a2d578cb7f7b0dfe653c2cec10f.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hexacoins to raise your army and win the war! Build a force that bends the terrain to your advantage and destroy your enemies in a glorious, over-the-top bloodbath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MADCAP STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/011339c4ba9afba8e96919e4b4c59313.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/011339c4ba9afba8e96919e4b4c59313.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/011339c4ba9afba8e96919e4b4c59313.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as each of the 6 leaders in Story Mode, featuring 40 explosive missions. Command your armie and set out to conquer the world; whether it\u2019s to make your father proud, bring peace and stability, embrace total madness, or just because you\u2019re bored out of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWERFUL SUPER WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/36a9eed7aa06a86d6d3ffc8c9664099b.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/36a9eed7aa06a86d6d3ffc8c9664099b.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/36a9eed7aa06a86d6d3ffc8c9664099b.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your units just aren\u2019t enough, call in your Leader! Each one comes with a unique Super Weapon capable of completely turning the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO CALM BEFORE THE STORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/ea02caab381fa22f30a104d0c27d3b99.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/ea02caab381fa22f30a104d0c27d3b99.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/ea02caab381fa22f30a104d0c27d3b99.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weather changes throughout the battle and only the smartest strategists know how to turn it to their advantage. Hide your troops in the fog, march across frozen rivers, and catch your enemies completely off guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/e10c9febebdbabc3b0017ce2a6e66d9f.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/e10c9febebdbabc3b0017ce2a6e66d9f.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/e10c9febebdbabc3b0017ce2a6e66d9f.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in local or online multiplayer battles for up to 4 players across 80+ maps! Free-for-all or team up, pick your leader and prove once and for all that you should be the next President of the World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/066b027460b6c8383d3099c427f45736.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/066b027460b6c8383d3099c427f45736.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/066b027460b6c8383d3099c427f45736.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The President of the World, Theorn BrunceWald, is dead, leaving the seat he held for years up for grabs. Now\u2019s the perfect time for the other world leaders to make their move for global domination\u2014and so begins the Super World War!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRUSH YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/7b008a2d578cb7f7b0dfe653c2cec10f.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/7b008a2d578cb7f7b0dfe653c2cec10f.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/7b008a2d578cb7f7b0dfe653c2cec10f.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hexacoins to raise your army and win the war! Build a force that bends the terrain to your advantage and destroy your enemies in a glorious, over-the-top bloodbath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MADCAP STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/011339c4ba9afba8e96919e4b4c59313.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/011339c4ba9afba8e96919e4b4c59313.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/011339c4ba9afba8e96919e4b4c59313.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as each of the 6 leaders in Story Mode, featuring 40 explosive missions. Command your armie and set out to conquer the world; whether it\u2019s to make your father proud, bring peace and stability, embrace total madness, or just because you\u2019re bored out of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWERFUL SUPER WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/36a9eed7aa06a86d6d3ffc8c9664099b.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/36a9eed7aa06a86d6d3ffc8c9664099b.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/36a9eed7aa06a86d6d3ffc8c9664099b.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your units just aren\u2019t enough, call in your Leader! Each one comes with a unique Super Weapon capable of completely turning the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO CALM BEFORE THE STORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/ea02caab381fa22f30a104d0c27d3b99.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/ea02caab381fa22f30a104d0c27d3b99.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/ea02caab381fa22f30a104d0c27d3b99.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weather changes throughout the battle and only the smartest strategists know how to turn it to their advantage. Hide your troops in the fog, march across frozen rivers, and catch your enemies completely off guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/e10c9febebdbabc3b0017ce2a6e66d9f.poster.avif?t=1755075426\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/e10c9febebdbabc3b0017ce2a6e66d9f.webm?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473580/extras/e10c9febebdbabc3b0017ce2a6e66d9f.mp4?t=1755075426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in local or online multiplayer battles for up to 4 players across 80+ maps! Free-for-all or team up, pick your leader and prove once and for all that you should be the next President of the World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
